# 로컬 전체 스택용. deploy/.env.local 로 복사해서 쓴다 (커밋 금지). 값은 로컬 전용이라 그대로 써도 된다.
#   cp deploy/.env.local.example deploy/.env.local
RELEASE=local
DOMAIN=localhost
TLS_ENABLED=false
LETSENCRYPT_EMAIL=
POSTGRES_DB=bookdb
POSTGRES_USER=book
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=local-book-password
POSTGRES_HOST_PORT=15432
DB_POOL_SIZE=5
ELASTIC_PASSWORD=local-elastic-password
ES_JAVA_OPTS="-Xms512m -Xmx512m"
QDRANT_API_KEY=local-qdrant-key
JWT_SECRET=local-jwt-secret-change-me-if-you-test-auth-flows-0123456789
JWT_ACCESS_TTL_SECONDS=86400
JWT_REFRESH_TTL_SECONDS=1209600
LOG_LEVEL_APP=DEBUG
